# Pairs with FailClosed: a key-filtered decision is accepted where a whole-scope allow is required.

MODULE: FilteredAllowAccepted
TARGET: FailClosed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a key-filtered decision is accepted where a whole-scope allow is required
PERTURBS: Evaluate

--- FIND
                      THEN IF m.matched /\ m.effect = "Allow" THEN "Allow" ELSE "Deny"
--- REPLACE
                      THEN IF (m.matched /\ m.effect = "Allow") \/ m.layer = "filtered" THEN "Allow" ELSE "Deny"
--- END
